<title>CANADA: Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</title>
<headline>Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board reported two vessels cleared, seven loading, five waiting and seven were due at the Canadian West Coast, as of Thursday.</p>
<p>The longest wait to load was 19 days.</p>
<p>    Port	 Loading	Waiting</p>
<p>    Vancouver	 7	     5</p>
<p>    Prince Rupert   0	     1</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
